# runs and review answers OUTSIDE the clone (point --file-root / --doc-root at
# them). `tests/test_reproducibility.py` also refuses a tracked PDF, archive,
# spreadsheet or any picture outside tests/, because a .gitignore can be
# overridden with `git add -f`.
